\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs26 \cf5 \cb3 \strokec5 Frutiger Aero is the glossy, optimistic design style of the mid-2000s to early 2010s, full of glassy buttons, bubbles, blue skies, lush greenery, and the belief that technology and nature could thrive together. 
\f3\b The Frutiger Aero Track challenges you to bring that utopian vision back to life by building projects that blend its signature aesthetic with real sustainability and nature-focused ideas. 
\f0\b0 Whether you're designing an eco-tracker with shimmering Vista-style UI, visualizing ocean or air-quality data through bubbly skeuomorphic interfaces, or creating tools that help people reconnect with the outdoors, this is your chance to make a greener future look as bright as we once imagined it.\cb1 \
\cb3 Clear skies, clean code. Let's build the future we were promised!\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

